title: Wired real World ID Selfie Check (VERIFICATION_MODE=world)
summary: 'Integrated the real World ID Selfie Check behind VERIFICATION_MODE (mock stays default). Server #worldid-service signs RP requests with @worldcoin/idkit-core signRequest (credential ''selfie'', per-session action binding) and verifies proofs at developer.world.org/api/v4/verify/{rp_id}. #verify-route gained GET /verify-context/:sessionId (RP signature for the SPA) and POST /verify/:sessionId (proof verify + settle); the mock GET is disabled in world mode to prevent bypass. SPA gained a /verify/:sessionId route rendering the @worldcoin/idkit IDKitRequestWidget with selfieCheckLegacy. All type-checks/builds pass; mock flow regression-clean; signRequest validated. World round-trip untested pending real creds + a World App selfie.'
