body: 'Design: VERIFICATION_MODE=mock|world mirrors PAYMENTS_MODE. In world mode the agent''s verification URL points at the SPA (APP_BASE_URL, default :5173) instead of the API; the SPA fetches /verify-context, renders the IDKit Selfie Check widget, and POSTs the proof back to the API which verifies with World then settles via the shared settleVerifiedSession helper. To go live: add WORLD_APP_ID/WORLD_RP_ID/WORLD_RP_SIGNING_KEY to server/.env, set VERIFICATION_MODE=world, restart the server (dotenv loads at boot), keep the client running, then run an agent purchase and complete the selfie in World App. Next: PR this on a fresh branch off main; later hardening = replay protection, environment prop, richer verify-response handling; then real Circle, Chrome-extension surface, MCP generalization, UX polish.'
